{"name":"Xanthophobia","hex":"#4a3e00","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"xanthophobia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Fear of the colour yellow.","An aversion to yellow light."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/xanthophobia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chromophobia","blocks":[{"text":"Chromophobia is a persistent, irrational fear of, or aversion to, colors and is usually a conditioned response. While actual clinical phobias to color are rare, colors can elicit hormonal responses and psychological reactions."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Bowl_of_Strawberries.jpg/330px-Bowl_of_Strawberries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chromophobia","wikidata":"Q8043081"}],"images":[],"sounds":{}}}